flowchart TB
    U[Upload or browser recording] --> V{Valid type, size ≤25 MB and duration ≤60 s?}
    V -->|No| RJ[Reject input with clear error]
    V -->|Yes| Q[Create ticket as queued / processing within 2 s]
    Q --> L[Store original audio locally]
    L --> P[Local preprocessing and quality checks]

    subgraph SIGNALS[Parallel local evidence paths]
        direction LR
        P --> S[Local speech-to-text]
        S --> N[Normalize transcript and mask identifiers]
        N --> T[Text analysis: category, complaint urgency, customer_state_text, summary]
        P --> A[Optional acoustic features and voice-state evidence]
    end

    N -. masked text only .-> G{Valid approval for this exact transfer?}
    AP[Approval ledger: scope, approver, provider/model, payload, purpose, retention] --> G
    G -->|No| B[External adapter blocks call; local path or review]
    G -->|Yes| X[External text-only provider]
    X -. structured result .-> T

    T --> J{Text schema and confidence valid?}
    J -->|No / unclear| H[needs_review with reason]
    J -->|Yes| F[Fusion; optional customer_state_final; urgency stays separate]
    A -->|if valid| F
    P -. audio-quality failure .-> H
    S -. provider failure .-> H
    A -. invalid or uncertain .-> H

    F --> M{Eligible agent available?}
    M -->|No| UN[Unassigned + supervisor review]
    M -->|Yes| AS[Assigned with route reason]

    H --> D[Local ticket store: completed / needs_review; assignment: assigned / unassigned]
    UN --> D
    AS --> D
    D --> W[Dashboard: queue, evidence and callback brief]
    D --> E[Evaluation runner]
    R[Agreed test split + run records] --> E
